2. **Iterate with `{{.CLI}} lint --static-export`; run the full gate ONCE, before you finish:** `{{.CLI}} lint && npm run build && {{.CLI}} env render {{$prod}}`. Never pipe lint through `head`: the verdict is the LAST line (`--quiet` prints only failures).
